ngle, compact card could significantly reduce wasted screen real estate. The uneven column height suggests a layout problem.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/styles.css\"","EndLine":"160","StartLine":"90","toolAction":"\"Viewing top-bar in styles.css\"","toolSummary":"\"View top-bar in styles.css\""}}]}
